rl":"https://api.github.com/users/DiamondBond/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiamondBond/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DiamondBond/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":78,"digest":"sha256:223c1b684e404e20440aa152adb9290ebec3d5495313be88b798602a44c80532","download_count":6,"created_at":"2026-10-16T19:15:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T19:15:28Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/DiamondBond/q2-rockbox/releases/download/v3.2/SHA256SUMS"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DiamondBond/q2-rockbox/tarball/v3.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DiamondBond/q2-rockbox/zipball/v3.2","body":"Shanling Q2 port updated to the latest upstream Rockbox master.\n\nUpstream changes since v3.1:\n- VGM playback now inflates compressed .vgz files while playing, and no longer reads past the end of the song or its samples.\n- Opus decoding allocates its Ogg buffers once, at their limits, and sizes them from the heap.\n- Bootloader and SPL image packaging build their tools before the images that use them (X1000, Sony NWZ).\n- Rockchip rk27xx: YP-CP3 NAND is writable through the FTL. Added the ZSP500 DSP assembler, simulator and test suite, and a clock configuration probe.\n- Build tools: the rockboxdev script supports aarch64 cross compiler toolchains.\n\nThe Q2 button mappings and headset controls are included. Install by unzipping `rockbox.zip` to the card's root so it creates `.rockbox/`. Your existing `config.cfg` is kept.\n"}